Package: jtbdtools
Title: Quantitative Jobs-to-Be-Done Analysis Using Outcome-Driven Innovation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Charles", "Rogers", , "charlesrogers@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-3162-0322"))
Description: Implements Ulwick's Outcome-Driven Innovation opportunity scoring
    formula. Calculates importance, satisfaction, and opportunity scores from
    Likert-scale survey data. Provides ggplot2 visualizations and gt tables
    for segment comparison and opportunity identification.
